      "message": "No tests to show what output we expect given various Starlark errors?\n\nThis sort of stuff seems like it can be prone to subtle mistakes because it has to account for all sorts of things like `load`s, does the call stack look right, getting 1 vs 0 indexed columns working right, the UX improvement of showing `whence \u0027foo\u0027 was called` instead of `whence it was called` etc",
